Package: textmood
Title: Evaluate the Vibes of a Text
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Maria", "Reina Campos", , "maria.reina.campos@ki.se", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads a text file, cleans it into a vector of lowercase words,
    and compares those words to user-supplied lists of positive and negative
    words. Itreturns the number of positive and negative words and a score that
    shows whether the text is overall positive or negative.
